 "remarks": "Rarely does a property emerge that feels more like a private island than a homesite. Positioned on a singular one-acre waterfront point, 1A Driftwood Point offers a once-in-a-lifetime canvas where the Long Island Sound meets Saugatuck Harbor. With over 200 feet of private beach and water views from every single room, this is the pinnacle of coastal living in Westport.  This exceptional property is offered as a custom build-out in collaboration with the award-winning Coastal Luxury Homes. Known for their philosophy \"Where life happens, beautifully,\" the team is ready to design and construct a bespoke estate tailored to your lifestyle, complete with a private pool and spa. The unique topography provides a breathtaking 270-degree panorama, overlooking the Sound and the Harbor, creating an atmosphere of total immersion in the maritime landscape.  While the setting feels worlds away, it remains incredibly connected. You are moments from the vibrant Saugatuck area, featuring some of the region's finest dining, boutique shopping, and the convenience of the train station.  With a new survey in hand and a potential dock site to explore, the opportunities for a true luxury lifestyle are endless. Reach out to discuss the vision for this waterfront masterpiece and explore how Coastal Luxury Homes can bring your dream estate to life.  *Photos include aerial views of the Driftwood Point location as well as a collection of styles and finishes from the Coastal Luxury Homes portfolio.",
